OL,3,GNEWSAMPs describe 'postbag full' of
OL,4,Amail delay complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said more than 500 people
OL,7,Fhave contacted her to report issues
OL,8,Fwith delays in receiving post over the
OL,9,Fpast six years.
OL,11,FLabour MP for Oxford East Dame
OL,12,FAnneliese Dodds said she had repeatedly
OL,13,Fmet with Royal Mail management after
OL,14,Fhundreds of people contacted her
OL,15,Foffice.
OL,17,FHer neighbouring MP, Liberal Democrat
OL,18,FLayla Moran, echoed a similar
OL,19,Fsentiment, saying her "postbag" was
OL,20,F"full" of stories of serious delays to
OL,21,Fdeliveries.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
